              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yakobo abarira Simeyoni na Lewi, ati Munkwegeye ibara, kuko mutumye nzinukwa na ben’ igihugu, Abanyakanani n’Abaferizi; kandi ko tur’ inkehwa, bazokwikoraniriza hamwe, bantere, mpeze ndanduke, ndanduranwe n’inzu yanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
